  "description": {
    "text": "Sold in North America from 9 May 2012, in two versions, each an evolution line with the Stage 1 in cosmos holofoil: the Riolu promo BW33 with Lucario, or the Meowth promo BW35 with Persian, both Stage 1s from Next Destinies, with a Dark Explorers booster pack and a three-card sampling pack. The holofoil Lucario and Persian aren't found in booster packs. Outside North America, Riolu came instead as a cosmos holofoil in the Next Destinies three-pack blister of February 2012.",
